# Prometheus/Grafana BINARIES live one level up, in note/observability/, and
# are never inside this repo. This guards against someone accidentally
# extracting or running them here instead - a Grafana install alone is ~350MB.
observability/prometheus/
observability/grafana/
observability/*.zip
